{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04924","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 卢藏用","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化塔龙山起，中天凤辇迂。\n彩旒牵画刹，杂佩冒香萸。\n宝叶擎千座，金英渍百盂。\n秋云飘圣藻，霄极捧连珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}